cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this book, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Electronics and Computing (Book 4 — The Electronics & Computing Core)"
abstract: >-
  An open textbook on electronic devices, analog and digital hardware,
  computer architecture, programming, embedded computation and
  hardware-software interaction: diodes, transistors and power devices,
  amplifiers, op-amps and analog ICs, digital logic and sequential design,
  processors, memory, FPGAs and HDLs, C/C++ and Python for engineers,
  algorithms and scientific computing, embedded and real-time systems,
  power-electronic converters, CMOS and VLSI design, and hardware-software
  co-design. 8 parts, 35 chapters and 197 computed figures, written in
  Markdown and LaTeX, with a typeset PDF and an MCP server.
authors:
  - given-names: "Golam Kuadir Khan"
    family-names: "Prince"
